{"hw":"φαῦλος","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">φαῦλος</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">φαῦλος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">η</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span>, also <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ος</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">ον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hipp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">435</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1083.9</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.21</span> </span>: (cf. <span class=\"gk\">φλαῦρος</span>):—<div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">cheap, easy, slight, paltry,</b> first found commonly in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> </span>, twicein <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.26</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">126</span> </span>(<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Comp.</span> </span>, elsewh.<span class=\"gk\">φλαῦρος</span>), six times in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Democr.</span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">87</span> </span>, al., twice in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span>, <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Frr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41</span> </span>,<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">771</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adv.</span> <span class=\"gk\">φαύλως</span> once in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">A.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pers.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">520</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">I</span> of things, <b class=\"lex-tr\">easy, slight,</b> <span class=\"gk\">φ. ἀθλήσας πόνον</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">317</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φαυλότατον ἔργον</span> ''tis as easy as lying', <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Eq.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">213</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φ. πρᾶγμα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lys.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">14</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ ζήτημα οὐ φ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">368c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φ. ἐρώτημα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Phlb.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19a</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φαῦλον αὐτοῖς προστάξομεν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">423c</span> </span>: freq. with negat., <span class=\"gk\">οὐ φ., ἀλλὰ χαλεπὸν πιστεῦσαι</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">527d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">μάχη οὐ φ.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">179d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ φ. τέχνη</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">223c</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὔτοι βασιλέα φαῦλόν [ἐστι] κτανεῖν</span> 'tis no <b class=\"lex-tr\">slight matter</b> to kill a king, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">El.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">760</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">νυκτὸς γὰρ οὔτι φ. ἐμβαλεῖν στρατόν</span> no <b class=\"lex-tr\">easy</b> matter, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">285</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">οὐ φ. πληγαί</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">54.13</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φιλοῦσιν ἰατροὶ λέγειν τὰ φαῦλα μείζω</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Men.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">497</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">φαῦλα ἐπιφέρειν</span> bring <b class=\"lex-tr\">paltry</b> charges, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.26</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὰ φ. νικήσας ἔχω</span> have gained <b class=\"lex-tr\">petty</b> victories, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">S.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Fr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">41</span> </span> (wrongly glossed by <span class=\"gk\">μέγα</span> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phot.</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Suid.</span> </span>, and <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">EM</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">789.43</span> </span>, cf. Hsch); <span class=\"gk\">σύμμαχον Τροίᾳ μολόντα Ῥῆσον οὐ φαύλῳ τρόπῳ,</span> i. e. with no <b class=\"lex-tr\">trivial</b> force, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">599</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">παρὰ φαῦλον